[{"answer":"Excuse me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if you could spare a few minutes to do a survey on transport. It won't take long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The survey is on behalf of the local council.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"They'd like to know about what transport you use and any suggestions for improvement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I start by asking you how you travelled to town today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. I came on the bus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Now can I get a few details about yourself?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Luisa...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Hardie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you spell that, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's H-A-R-D-I-E.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Thanks. And can I have your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 19, White Stone Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right. I know that area. It's Bradfield, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Is the postcode GT7?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It's actually GT82LC.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. And could I ask what your job is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you a student?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've actually just finished my training.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a hairdresser.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And one more question in this section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"What is the reason for you coming into town today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually it's not for shopping today, which would be my normal reason,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but to see the dentist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Now in this last section I'd like you to give us some ideas about the facilities and arrangements in the city for getting to and from work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Any suggestions you have for improvements?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, something I've thought about for some time is that when I do walk and I'm doing a later shift,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the lighting should be better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, good point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, I think it's a real shame they've been cutting down on the number of footpaths.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"They should have more of those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Then people would walk more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And, I don't think there are enough trains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why I don't use them - you have to wait so long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally I'd like to ask your opinion on cycling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"As you may know, there's a drive in the city to get more people to cycle to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"But we realise that there are things which the council, but also employers, might do to help encourage workers to cycle to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I have thought about it and where I work there are no safe places to leave your bikes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And also, I'd have to cycle uphill","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and on a hot day I'd arrive at work pretty sweaty so I think I'd need a shower somewhere at work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And I suppose the last thing is that I wouldn't be all that confident about cycling on such busy roads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'd like to see you offering training for that, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd feel a lot better about starting if that was the case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much for your time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem. Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-2-part-1-2023-06-13-22-01-33/61.mp3"}]
